      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5501594543457031
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "The accused were acquitted for the reason of not having an opportunity of getting the sample tested.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 293,
      "end": 393,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4998241662979126
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "Notice under Section 13 (2) of the Act was not given.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 394,
      "end": 447,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 13 (2)",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 407,
          "end": 421
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20781221985816956
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "3. It is the case of the Food Inspector that sample oil was taken from the premises of the accused.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 448,
      "end": 548,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23758366703987122
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "The said soya bean oil was sent for analysis and it was found that it failed quality test.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 549,
      "end": 640,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25364962220191956
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "4. Learned Magistrate acquitted the accused on the ground that no opportunity was given to retest the sample.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RLC",
      "start": 641,
      "end": 751,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.33863168954849243
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "5. In the absence of accused being given an opportunity to send the sample for examination to Central Lab, there is violation under Section 13(2) of the Act.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 753,
      "end": 910,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 13(2)",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 885,
          "end": 898
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4951779246330261
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "There are no grounds to interfere with the order of acquittal.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 911,
      "end": 973,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.32898229360580444
    },
    {
